<view class="container">
  <view class="head">
    <view class="head-title">套餐与额度</view>
    <view class="muted small">额度按周期续发；升级后立即生效。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="plan-card {{item.code === currentPlan ? 'plan-current' : ''}}" a:for="{{plans}}" a:key="code">
    <view class="row-between">
      <view>
        <text class="plan-name">{{item.name}}</text>
        <text class="badge badge-ember" a:if="{{item.code === currentPlan}}">当前</text>
      </view>
      <view class="plan-price">
        <text class="plan-amount">{{item.priceText}}</text>
        <text class="tiny muted" a:if="{{item.priceCents > 0}}">/ {{item.periodDays}} 天</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="plan-credits">
      面试 {{item.interviewCredits}} 次 · 简历解析 {{item.resumeCredits}} 次
    </view>
    <view class="chip-row">
      <text class="chip-mini" a:for="{{item.featureList}}" a:for-item="feature" a:key="*this">{{feature}}</text>
    </view>
    <button
      class="btn {{item.code === currentPlan ? 'btn-ghost' : ''}}"
      a:if="{{item.priceCents > 0}}"
      data-code="{{item.code}}"
      onTap="buy"
      disabled="{{buying}}"
    >
      {{buying && buyingCode === item.code ? phase : '购买并支付'}}
    </button>
  </view>

  <view class="notice">
    <view class="notice-title">支付说明</view>
    <view class="tiny muted">
      支付由支付宝完成，金额与套餐以服务端为准。支付成功后额度自动到账；若通道未开通，会提示暂不可用。
    </view>
    <view class="tiny muted" a:if="{{channelText}}">可用渠道：{{channelText}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="safe-bottom"></view>
</view>
